{{!
    @template local_partners/landing

    Pagina de captacao de empresas parceiras.

    Template BURRO de proposito: so secoes e lacos, nenhuma logica. Todo texto
    vem de string de idioma e todo numero vem do banco, preparado pelo
    landing_page. Uma tabela de precos escrita aqui envelheceria no primeiro
    reajuste, e o visitante veria um numero que o sistema nao pratica.

    Os id= das secoes NAO sao escritos aqui: saem do export "sections", a mesma
    lista que alimenta a barra de secoes. Escrever a lista duas vezes e como uma
    ancora passa a apontar para lugar nenhum sem ninguem notar.

    NAO escreva chave dupla de mustache dentro deste comentario. O comentario
    termina no PRIMEIRO fecha-chaves, entao uma tag citada aqui encerra o bloco
    e joga o resto do texto na tela do visitante. Ja aconteceu.

    O estilo mora em local/partners/styles.css, e nao no tema: a pagina precisa
    renderizar igual sob theme_boost e theme_moove.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * applyurl - URL do formulario de candidatura
    * heroimage - URL da imagem do hero
    * colormode - 'dark' ou 'light', ja resolvido no servidor
    * sections - array de { id, label }, na ordem da pagina
    * plans - array de planos: name, description, isfree, monthlyfee,
              commissionpct, isbyos, hosting, tiers, hastiers
    * hasplans - boolean
    * steps - array de { number, title, text, chip }
    * faq - array de { id, question, answer }

    Example context (json):
    {
        "applyurl": "/local/partners/apply.php",
        "heroimage": "/local/partners/pix/hero.jpg",
        "colormode": "dark",
        "sections": [
            {"id": "ldgp-features", "label": "Features"},
            {"id": "ldgp-pricing", "label": "Plans"},
            {"id": "ldgp-how", "label": "How it works"},
            {"id": "ldgp-faq", "label": "FAQ"},
            {"id": "ldgp-apply", "label": "Apply"}
        ],
        "hasplans": true,
        "plans": [
            {
                "name": "Starter",
                "description": "Zero monthly fee.",
                "isfree": true,
                "monthlyfee": "R$ 0,00",
                "commissionpct": "9.90",
                "isbyos": false,
                "hosting": "Hosting included",
                "hastiers": true,
                "tiers": [{"label": "Up to R$ 49.90", "resolution": "720p"}]
            }
        ],
        "steps": [{"number": 1, "title": "Apply", "text": "Fill the form.", "chip": "1 min"}],
        "faq": [{"id": "ldgfaq1", "question": "How much?", "answer": "9.9%."}]
    }
}}
<div class="ldgp ldgp--landing" data-bs-theme="{{colormode}}">

    {{! O visitante anonimo que escolheu claro guardou a escolha no navegador, e
        o servidor nao tem como saber disso. Este script corrige o atributo
        ANTES da pintura: um bloco js do Moodle sairia no fim do body e passaria
        pelo RequireJS, que e assincrono - daria pisca garantido. O try/catch nao
        e enfeite, o localStorage lanca em navegacao privada. }}
    <script>
        (function() {
            try {
                var m = localStorage.getItem('local_partners-colormode');
                if (m === 'light' || m === 'dark') {
                    document.currentScript.parentElement.setAttribute('data-bs-theme', m);

                    // O chrome do tema acompanha, mas SO se ele ja for dono do
                    // atributo. Sob theme_ldg isso evita a pagina clara com a
                    // navbar escura depois de recarregar; sob Boost e Moove, que
                    // nao tem desenho escuro para o cabecalho, nao mexemos.
                    if (document.body && document.body.hasAttribute('data-bs-theme')) {
                        document.body.setAttribute('data-bs-theme', m);
                    }
                }
            } catch (e) {
                // Sem armazenamento local, vale o que o servidor decidiu.
            }
        }());
    </script>

    {{> local_partners/sectionbar }}

    <main id="ldgp-main" tabindex="-1">

    {{! A imagem e o FUNDO da secao, e nao uma figura abaixo do texto: o
        hero ocupa a largura toda e o miolo continua no container. O
        endereco vem do PHP, entao o style inline e o unico caminho. }}
    <section class="ldgp-hero" style="background-image: url('{{heroimage}}');">
        <div class="ldgp-inner">
            <p class="ldgp-pill">
                <span class="ldgp-dot"></span>
                <span>{{#str}}heropill, local_partners{{/str}}</span>
            </p>

            <h1 class="ldgp-herotitle">
                {{#str}}herotitle, local_partners{{/str}}
                <span class="ldgp-gradient">{{#str}}herotitleaccent, local_partners{{/str}}</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="ldgp-herolead">{{#str}}herolead, local_partners{{/str}}</p>

            <div class="ldgp-heroactions">
                <a href="{{applyurl}}" class="ldgp-btn ldgp-btn--primary">
                    {{#str}}heroctatext, local_partners{{/str}}
                    {{> local_partners/icons/arrowright }}
                </a>
                <a href="#ldgp-pricing" class="ldgp-btn ldgp-btn--ghost">
                    {{#str}}heroctasecondary, local_partners{{/str}}
                </a>
            </div>

            <ul class="ldgp-herostats">
                <li>{{> local_partners/icons/check }}<span>{{#str}}herostat1, local_partners{{/str}}</span></li>
                <li>{{> local_partners/icons/check }}<span>{{#str}}herostat2, local_partners{{/str}}</span></li>
                <li>{{> local_partners/icons/check }}<span>{{#str}}herostat3, local_partners{{/str}}</span></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ldgp-section" id="ldgp-features">
        <div class="ldgp-inner">
            <div class="ldgp-sectionhead">
                <p class="ldgp-eyebrow">{{#str}}valueeyebrow, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                <h2 class="ldgp-sectiontitle">{{#str}}valuetitle, local_partners{{/str}}</h2>
                <p class="ldgp-sectionlead">{{#str}}valuelead, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="ldgp-grid ldgp-grid--pillars">
                <article class="ldgp-pillar">
                    <div>
                        <span class="ldgp-icontile">{{> local_partners/icons/coin }}</span>
                        <h3>{{#str}}value1title, local_partners{{/str}}</h3>
                        <p>{{#str}}value1text, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="ldgp-pillarnote">{{#str}}value1note, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                </article>

                <article class="ldgp-pillar">
                    <div>
                        <span class="ldgp-icontile">{{> local_partners/icons/server }}</span>
                        <h3>{{#str}}value2title, local_partners{{/str}}</h3>
                        <p>{{#str}}value2text, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="ldgp-pillarnote">{{#str}}value2note, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                </article>

                <article class="ldgp-pillar">
                    <div>
                        <span class="ldgp-icontile">{{> local_partners/icons/shield }}</span>
                        <h3>{{#str}}value3title, local_partners{{/str}}</h3>
                        <p>{{#str}}value3text, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="ldgp-pillarnote">{{#str}}value3note, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                </article>

                <article class="ldgp-pillar">
                    <div>
                        <span class="ldgp-icontile">{{> local_partners/icons/globe }}</span>
                        <h3>{{#str}}value4title, local_partners{{/str}}</h3>
                        <p>{{#str}}value4text, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="ldgp-pillarnote">{{#str}}value4note, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    {{#hasplans}}
        <section class="ldgp-section ldgp-section--alt" id="ldgp-pricing">
            <div class="ldgp-inner">
                <div class="ldgp-sectionhead ldgp-sectionhead--center">
                    <p class="ldgp-eyebrow">{{#str}}planseyebrow, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                    <h2 class="ldgp-sectiontitle">{{#str}}planstitle, local_partners{{/str}}</h2>
                    <p class="ldgp-sectionlead">{{#str}}planslead, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                </div>

                <div class="ldgp-grid ldgp-grid--plans">
                    {{#plans}}
                        <div class="ldgp-plan{{#isfree}} ldgp-plan--featured{{/isfree}}">
                            {{#isfree}}
                                <span class="ldgp-planbadge">{{#str}}planbadgepopular, local_partners{{/str}}</span>
                            {{/isfree}}

                            <div class="ldgp-planhead">
                                <h3>{{name}}</h3>
                                <span class="ldgp-tag{{^isbyos}} ldgp-tag--primary{{/isbyos}}">{{hosting}}</span>
                            </div>

                            <p class="ldgp-plandesc">{{description}}</p>

                            <p class="ldgp-price">
                                {{#isfree}}
                                    <span class="ldgp-pricevalue">{{#str}}planfree, local_partners{{/str}}</span>
                                {{/isfree}}
                                {{^isfree}}
                                    <span class="ldgp-pricevalue">{{monthlyfee}}</span>
                                    <span class="ldgp-priceunit">{{#str}}permonth, local_partners{{/str}}</span>
                                {{/isfree}}
                            </p>

                            <p class="ldgp-commission{{#isfree}} ldgp-commission--free{{/isfree}}">
                                {{#str}}plancommission, local_partners, {{commissionpct}}{{/str}}
                            </p>

                            {{#hastiers}}
                                <div class="ldgp-tiers">
                                    <p class="ldgp-tierslabel">{{#str}}tierslabel, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                                    <ul class="ldgp-tierlist">
                                        {{#tiers}}
                                            <li><span>{{label}}</span> <strong>{{resolution}}</strong></li>
                                        {{/tiers}}
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            {{/hastiers}}

                            {{^hastiers}}
                                <p class="ldgp-hosting">
                                    {{> local_partners/icons/bolt }}
                                    <span>{{hosting}}</span>
                                </p>
                            {{/hastiers}}

                            <div class="ldgp-planfoot">
                                <a href="{{applyurl}}" class="ldgp-btn ldgp-btn--block{{#isfree}} ldgp-btn--primary{{/isfree}}{{^isfree}} ldgp-btn--ghost{{/isfree}}">
                                    {{#str}}planctatext, local_partners{{/str}}
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    {{/plans}}
                </div>

                <p class="ldgp-note">{{#str}}plansnote, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    {{/hasplans}}

    <section class="ldgp-section" id="ldgp-how">
        <div class="ldgp-inner">
            <div class="ldgp-sectionhead">
                <p class="ldgp-eyebrow">{{#str}}howeyebrow, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                <h2 class="ldgp-sectiontitle">{{#str}}howtitle, local_partners{{/str}}</h2>
                <p class="ldgp-sectionlead">{{#str}}howlead, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="ldgp-grid ldgp-grid--steps">
                {{#steps}}
                    <div class="ldgp-step">
                        <div class="ldgp-stephead">
                            <span class="ldgp-stepnumber">{{number}}</span>
                            <h3>{{title}}</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p>{{text}}</p>
                    </div>
                {{/steps}}
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ldgp-section ldgp-section--alt ldgp-faq" id="ldgp-faq">
        <div class="ldgp-inner">
            <div class="ldgp-sectionhead ldgp-sectionhead--center">
                <p class="ldgp-eyebrow">{{#str}}faqeyebrow, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
                <h2 class="ldgp-sectiontitle">{{#str}}faqtitle, local_partners{{/str}}</h2>
                <p class="ldgp-sectionlead">{{#str}}faqlead, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion" id="ldgp-faq-accordion">
                {{#faq}}
                    <div class="accordion-item">
                        <h3 class="accordion-header" id="{{id}}-header">
                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                                    data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#{{id}}"
                                    aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="{{id}}">
                                {{question}}
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <div id="{{id}}" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                             aria-labelledby="{{id}}-header" data-bs-parent="#ldgp-faq-accordion">
                            <div class="accordion-body">{{answer}}</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                {{/faq}}
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ldgp-section ldgp-cta" id="ldgp-apply">
        <div class="ldgp-inner">
            <h2 class="ldgp-ctatitle">{{#str}}ctatitle, local_partners{{/str}}</h2>
            <p class="ldgp-ctalead">{{#str}}ctalead, local_partners{{/str}}</p>

            <div class="ldgp-ctaactions">
                <a href="{{applyurl}}" class="ldgp-btn ldgp-btn--primary">
                    {{#str}}heroctatext, local_partners{{/str}}
                    {{> local_partners/icons/arrowright }}
                </a>
                <a href="#ldgp-faq" class="ldgp-btn ldgp-btn--ghost">
                    {{#str}}ctasecondary, local_partners{{/str}}
                </a>
            </div>

            <p class="ldgp-ctanote">{{#str}}ctanote, local_partners{{/str}}</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    </main>

    {{#footer}}{{> local_partners/footer }}{{/footer}}
</div>
{{#js}}
    require(['local_partners/sectionbar', 'local_partners/colormode'], function(Bar, ColorMode) {
        Bar.init();
        ColorMode.init({{#isloggedin}}true{{/isloggedin}}{{^isloggedin}}false{{/isloggedin}});
    });
{{/js}}
